                    ['term' => 'ragged', 'reading' => null, 'romaji' => null, 'meaning' => 'compang-camping, kumal', 'example' => null, 'example_meaning' => null, 'extra' => ['type' => 'glossary']],
                    ['term' => 'ashamed', 'reading' => null, 'romaji' => null, 'meaning' => 'malu', 'example' => null, 'example_meaning' => null, 'extra' => ['type' => 'glossary']],
                    ['term' => 'heartbroken', 'reading' => null, 'romaji' => null, 'meaning' => 'sangat sedih, patah hati', 'example' => null, 'example_meaning' => null, 'extra' => ['type' => 'glossary']],
                    ['term' => 'cruelty', 'reading' => null, 'romaji' => null, 'meaning' => 'kekejaman', 'example' => null, 'example_meaning' => null, 'extra' => ['type' => 'glossary']],
                    ['term' => 'pride', 'reading' => null, 'romaji' => null, 'meaning' => 'kesombongan', 'example' => null, 'example_meaning' => null, 'extra' => ['type' => 'glossary']],
                ],
            ],
            [
                'title' => 'Bawang Merah dan Bawang Putih',
                'level' => 'Elementary',
                'summary' => 'Cerita rakyat tentang seorang gadis baik hati dan saudara tirinya yang serakah.',
                'minutes' => 10,
                'xp' => 25,
                'content' => "Once upon a time, there lived a kind girl named Bawang Putih. After her mother died, her father married a woman who already had a daughter named Bawang Merah. Her stepmother and stepsister were lazy and unkind, and they forced Bawang Putih to do all the housework, from cooking to washing clothes at the river.\n\nOne day, while washing clothes, Bawang Putih accidentally dropped her stepmother's favorite scarf into the river. She followed the flowing water along the riverbank until she found an old woman living in a small hut. \"Grandmother, have you seen a scarf floating by?\" Bawang Putih asked politely.\n\nThe old woman said she had the scarf, but first asked Bawang Putih to help her with some chores. Bawang Putih happily helped clean the house and cook, without complaining even once. Pleased with her kindness, the old woman returned the scarf and offered her a gift: two pumpkins, one big and one small. \"Choose one,\" said the old woman. Bawang Putih, being humble, chose the small pumpkin.\n\nWhen she returned home and cut the small pumpkin open, she was amazed to find it full of gold, jewelry, and beautiful clothes! Her stepmother and Bawang Merah were shocked and jealous when they saw the treasure.\n\nThe next day, Bawang Merah went to the river herself and threw the scarf into the water on purpose. She found the same old woman and demanded the scarf back rudely, refusing to help with any chores. Still, the old woman offered her the same choice: a big pumpkin or a small one. Bawang Merah, thinking only of greed, grabbed the big pumpkin without even saying thank you.\n\nBack home, Bawang Merah eagerly cut open the big pumpkin, expecting even more treasure than her stepsister. But instead, dangerous snakes and insects poured out of it! She learned, too late, that kindness and humility are worth far more than greed.",
                'translated_content' => "Pada zaman dahulu, hiduplah seorang gadis baik hati bernama Bawang Putih. Setelah ibunya meninggal, ayahnya menikah lagi dengan seorang perempuan yang sudah memiliki seorang anak perempuan bernama Bawang Merah. Ibu tiri dan saudara tirinya itu pemalas dan tidak baik hati, dan mereka memaksa Bawang Putih mengerjakan semua pekerjaan rumah, mulai dari memasak hingga mencuci pakaian di sungai.\n\nSuatu hari, saat sedang mencuci pakaian, Bawang Putih tanpa sengaja menjatuhkan selendang kesayangan ibu tirinya ke sungai. Ia mengikuti aliran air di sepanjang tepi sungai hingga menemukan seorang nenek tua yang tinggal di sebuah gubuk kecil. \"Nek, apakah Nenek melihat selendang yang hanyut?\" tanya Bawang Putih dengan sopan.\n\nNenek itu berkata bahwa ia menyimpan selendang tersebut, tetapi terlebih dahulu meminta Bawang Putih membantunya mengerjakan beberapa pekerjaan rumah. Bawang Putih dengan senang hati membantu membersihkan rumah dan memasak, tanpa mengeluh sedikit pun. Karena senang dengan kebaikannya, nenek itu mengembalikan selendangnya dan menawarkan hadiah: dua buah labu, satu besar dan satu kecil. \"Pilihlah salah satu,\" kata nenek itu. Bawang Putih, karena rendah hati, memilih labu yang kecil.\n\nKetika ia pulang dan membelah labu kecil itu, ia sangat terkejut mendapati labu itu penuh dengan emas, perhiasan, dan pakaian indah! Ibu tiri dan Bawang Merah terkejut sekaligus iri hati saat melihat harta itu.\n\nKeesokan harinya, Bawang Merah pergi sendiri ke sungai dan sengaja membuang selendang itu ke air. Ia menemukan nenek yang sama dan meminta selendangnya kembali dengan kasar, menolak membantu pekerjaan apa pun. Meski begitu, nenek itu tetap menawarkan pilihan yang sama: labu besar atau labu kecil. Bawang Merah, yang hanya memikirkan keserakahan, langsung mengambil labu besar tanpa mengucapkan terima kasih.\n\nSetibanya di rumah, Bawang Merah dengan tidak sabar membelah labu besar itu, berharap mendapat harta yang lebih banyak daripada saudara tirinya. Namun yang keluar justru ular-ular dan serangga berbahaya! Ia pun menyadari, meski sudah terlambat, bahwa kebaikan hati dan kerendahan hati jauh lebih berharga daripada keserakahan.",
                'items' => [
                    ['term' => 'stepmother', 'reading' => null, 'romaji' => null, 'meaning' => 'ibu tiri', 'example' => null, 'example_meaning' => null, 'extra' => ['type' => 'glossary']],
                    ['term' => 'lazy', 'reading' => null, 'romaji' => null, 'meaning' => 'malas', 'example' => null, 'example_meaning' => null, 'extra' => ['type' => 'glossary']],
                    ['term' => 'riverbank', 'reading' => null, 'romaji' => null, 'meaning' => 'tepi sungai', 'example' => null, 'example_meaning' => null, 'extra' => ['type' => 'glossary']],
                    ['term' => 'humble', 'reading' => null, 'romaji' => null, 'meaning' => 'rendah hati', 'example' => null, 'example_meaning' => null, 'extra' => ['type' => 'glossary']],
                    ['term' => 'jealous', 'reading' => null, 'romaji' => null, 'meaning' => 'iri hati', 'example' => null, 'example_meaning' => null, 'extra' => ['type' => 'glossary']],
                    ['term' => 'greed', 'reading' => null, 'romaji' => null, 'meaning' => 'keserakahan', 'example' => null, 'example_meaning' => null, 'extra' => ['type' => 'glossary']],
