            [
                'title' => 'Conditional Sentence Type 0, 1, dan 2',
                'level' => 'Upper-Intermediate',
                'summary' => '*Conditional sentence* menyatakan hubungan sebab-akibat antara syarat (*if-clause*) dan hasilnya (*main clause*). Type 0 dipakai untuk fakta umum, Type 1 untuk kondisi nyata yang mungkin terjadi di masa depan, dan Type 2 untuk kondisi *hypothetical* (khayalan) yang bertentangan dengan kenyataan saat ini.',
                'minutes' => 18,
                'xp' => 35,
                'content' => "<p>Setiap tipe conditional memiliki rumus tense yang berbeda pada if-clause dan main clause, tergantung tingkat kepastian atau kenyataan dari kondisi yang dibicarakan.</p>\n<table>\n<thead><tr><th>Tipe</th><th>Rumus</th><th>Fungsi</th><th>Contoh</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>Type 0</td><td>If + S + V1, S + V1</td><td>Fakta umum / kebenaran ilmiah</td><td>If you heat ice, it melts.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Type 1</td><td>If + S + V1, S + will + V1</td><td>Kondisi nyata/mungkin terjadi di masa depan</td><td>If it rains, we will stay home.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Type 2</td><td>If + S + V2, S + would + V1</td><td>Kondisi tidak nyata/khayalan di masa sekarang</td><td>If I had wings, I would fly.</td></tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><strong>Catatan penting:</strong> pada Type 2, gunakan <strong>were</strong> untuk semua subjek (I/he/she/it/we/they) dalam if-clause sebagai bentuk subjunctive, bukan \"was\". Klausa if dan main clause bisa ditukar posisinya; jika if-clause di awal, gunakan koma.</p>",
                'items' => [
                    ['term' => 'Formula', 'reading' => null, 'romaji' => null, 'meaning' => 'Type 0: If + S+V1, S+V1 · Type 1: If + S+V1, S+will+V1 · Type 2: If + S+V2, S+would+V1', 'example' => null, 'example_meaning' => null, 'extra' => ['type' => 'formula', 'kind' => 'structure']],
                    ['term' => 'contoh-1', 'reading' => null, 'romaji' => null, 'meaning' => null, 'example' => 'If you **heat** ice, it **melts**.', 'example_meaning' => 'Jika kamu memanaskan es, es itu mencair.', 'extra' => ['type' => 'example']],
                    ['term' => 'contoh-2', 'reading' => null, 'romaji' => null, 'meaning' => null, 'example' => 'Water **boils** if it **reaches** 100 degrees Celsius.', 'example_meaning' => 'Air mendidih jika mencapai 100 derajat Celsius.', 'extra' => ['type' => 'example']],
                    ['term' => 'contoh-3', 'reading' => null, 'romaji' => null, 'meaning' => null, 'example' => 'If it **rains** tomorrow, we **will cancel** the picnic.', 'example_meaning' => 'Jika besok hujan, kami akan membatalkan piknik.', 'extra' => ['type' => 'example']],
                    ['term' => 'contoh-4', 'reading' => null, 'romaji' => null, 'meaning' => null, 'example' => 'If you **study** hard, you **will pass** the exam.', 'example_meaning' => 'Jika kamu belajar dengan giat, kamu akan lulus ujian.', 'extra' => ['type' => 'example']],
                    ['term' => 'contoh-5', 'reading' => null, 'romaji' => null, 'meaning' => null, 'example' => 'If I **had** a lot of money, I **would travel** around the world.', 'example_meaning' => 'Jika saya punya banyak uang, saya akan berkeliling dunia.', 'extra' => ['type' => 'example']],
                    ['term' => 'contoh-6', 'reading' => null, 'romaji' => null, 'meaning' => null, 'example' => 'If she **were** taller, she **would join** the basketball team.', 'example_meaning' => 'Jika dia lebih tinggi, dia akan bergabung dengan tim basket.', 'extra' => ['type' => 'example']],
                    ['term' => 'contoh-7', 'reading' => null, 'romaji' => null, 'meaning' => null, 'example' => 'If you **mix** blue and yellow, you **get** green.', 'example_meaning' => 'Jika kamu mencampur biru dan kuning, kamu mendapatkan hijau.', 'extra' => ['type' => 'example']],
                    ['term' => 'contoh-8', 'reading' => null, 'romaji' => null, 'meaning' => null, 'example' => 'Plants **die** if they **do not get** enough sunlight.', 'example_meaning' => 'Tumbuhan mati jika mereka tidak mendapatkan cukup sinar matahari.', 'extra' => ['type' => 'example']],
                    ['term' => 'contoh-9', 'reading' => null, 'romaji' => null, 'meaning' => null, 'example' => 'Metal **expands** when it **is heated**.', 'example_meaning' => 'Logam memuai ketika dipanaskan.', 'extra' => ['type' => 'example']],
                    ['term' => 'contoh-10', 'reading' => null, 'romaji' => null, 'meaning' => null, 'example' => 'If you **do not sleep** enough, you **feel** tired.', 'example_meaning' => 'Jika kamu tidak cukup tidur, kamu merasa lelah.', 'extra' => ['type' => 'example']],
